1	IFA	For Approval		Internal Use Only
2	IFFR	For Final Review		Used when a document requires an additional review or approval after the initial review of the document has been completed.
3	IFI	For Information		Originator provides the Document to COMPANY for information and reference. No response is requested from COMPANY.
4	IFPR	For Priority Review		Originator submits document for review by COMPANY on a shorter schedule agreed upon with COMPANY.
5	IFR	For Review		Originator submits document for review by COMPANY. COMPANY will respond to originator upon completion of the review. Does not prevent contractor from proceeding with work.
6	LO	Load Only		Internal Use Only
7	RFI	For RFI Review		Originator requests information from COMPANY and COMPANY will return after reviewing and commenting.
